            <sparkle:version>194</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.9.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>Check Now always gets Homebrew&#x27;s latest list of apps, and automatic checks refresh it every hour (was every 12), so new versions such as IntelliJ IDEA 2026.3 show the same day.</li>
  <li>Updates says when Homebrew packages are waiting, with a button to open the Homebrew page.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
